WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.836
-Robert De Niro
is my guest tonight.

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.904
-Ohh!

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:07.407
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:09.742
-I saw De Niro backstage,
and I was like,

00:00:09.742 --> 00:00:12.011
"You're on the show.

00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:14.380
It's good. It's good.
You're on the show."

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.749
And he said, "Keep doing that,
and I won't be."

00:00:16.749 --> 00:00:17.984
And I go...

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:19.852
Robert stars in the new movie
"The Irishman"

00:00:19.852 --> 00:00:22.055
with Al Pacino and Joe Pesci.

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:25.024
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.024 --> 00:00:27.160
It's a little strange
to hear those three guys

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.795
in a movie called
"The Irishman." That's...

00:00:29.795 --> 00:00:32.031
That's like a movie starring
Liam Neeson, Colin Farrell,

00:00:32.031 --> 00:00:34.967
and Pierce Brosnan
called "The Italians."

00:00:34.967 --> 00:00:37.437
[ Irish accent ] "You try
the lasagna now, then."

00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:39.839
This is the third night in a row

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:42.542
we are coming to you live,
everybody!

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.511
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:46.078 --> 00:00:48.214
But don't worry. Don't worry.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:51.150
If you missed anything, we have
a White House staffer backstage

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.352
typing up a transcript, so...

00:00:53.352 --> 00:00:55.054
That's right.
That's the big news today.

00:00:55.054 --> 00:00:57.757
Trump released the transcript
of his phone call

00:00:57.757 --> 00:00:59.458
with the president of Ukraine.

00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:02.228
It started with him saying...

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:10.537
And Trump said,
"But enough about me."

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:12.839
Then later in the transcript,
there was a pretty damaging part

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:14.674
where Trump talks about
Biden's son.

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:16.409
When Trump saw that part,
he said,

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:17.777
"That can't be my transcript.

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:20.313
It looks nothing like
my handwriting."

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:22.381
You can tell Trump is
running out of explanations.

00:01:22.381 --> 00:01:24.150
Today he was like,
"It's not me on the transcript.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:26.719
It's Alec Baldwin."

00:01:26.719 --> 00:01:28.520
The situation
is escalating fast.

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:29.689
Today it was all about

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:31.824
impeachment, whistle-blowers,
transcripts.

00:01:31.824 --> 00:01:34.093
Can't we go back
to when things were simpler

00:01:34.093 --> 00:01:38.030
and the President was just
fighting with Chrissy Teigen?

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:40.133
Now a lot of Democrats
have come out to show

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.201
their support for
the impeachment of Trump.

00:01:42.201 --> 00:01:44.571
You could tell they're onboard
because Nancy Pelosi

00:01:44.571 --> 00:01:49.042
crowd-surfed her way
into the office today.

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:51.744
A lot of people are calling
the transcript a smoking gun,

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:53.813
which explains
why today Trump said,

00:01:53.813 --> 00:01:57.450
"Okay. Now I'm ready
for gun control."

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.051
And this is crazy.
Today Trump actually

00:01:59.051 --> 00:02:01.153
met in person with
the president of Ukraine.

00:02:01.153 --> 00:02:02.522
Take a look at this.

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:04.991
-I know that you've
never been in Ukraine.

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:09.061
Can you give me a word that you
will come to our great country?

00:02:09.061 --> 00:02:11.030
-Well, I'm going to try.

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:13.199
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:17.670
-Eric and Don Jr. heard that
and were like,

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.271
"Well, based on all of
our Little League games,

00:02:19.271 --> 00:02:20.840
trust us, he's not showing up."

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:24.210
"I'm gonna try to be there
for you guys. I don't know."

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:26.079
After that,
Trump held a press conference

00:02:26.079 --> 00:02:27.847
and listed all the countries
he's met with this week.

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:29.082
Check it out.

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:31.984
&gt;&gt; Pakistan, Poland,
New Zealand,

00:02:31.984 --> 00:02:34.520
Singapore, Egypt,

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:39.492
South Korea,
United Kingdom, India.

00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:42.528
-"And that's just one visit
to Epcot."

00:02:42.528 --> 00:02:44.030
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.999
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:50.502 --> 00:02:52.538
That's right.
This impeachment story is huge,

00:02:52.538 --> 00:02:54.740
and the media is really racing
to keep up with it.

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.075
It's getting kind of nuts.

00:02:56.075 --> 00:02:58.377
Look what I saw on CNN.
This is real.

00:02:58.377 --> 00:03:01.047
There's news scrolling
on the bottom of the screen

00:03:01.047 --> 00:03:03.215
and the top!

00:03:03.215 --> 00:03:06.786
It got even crazier later.
Look at this video.

00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:08.755
&gt;&gt; The complaint that started...

00:03:08.755 --> 00:03:09.922
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.922 --> 00:03:11.124
-Ridiculous.
You can't even see.

00:03:11.124 --> 00:03:13.693
I feel bad for Wolf Blitzer.
-Oh, come on.

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:15.694
-Some TV news tonight.
On NBC, there was

00:03:15.694 --> 00:03:17.162
and all-new "Chicago Med,"

00:03:17.162 --> 00:03:19.666
"Chicago Fire,"
and "Chicago PD".

00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:21.767
That was followed by
"Chicago Post Office,"

00:03:21.767 --> 00:03:25.537
"Chicago DMV,"
and "Chicago Zoo."

00:03:25.537 --> 00:03:28.140
And, finally, Amazon announced
that you'll soon be able to get

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:32.044
Samuel L. Jackson to be
the voice of your Amazon Echo.

00:03:32.044 --> 00:03:34.280
Yeah, and when they told Alexa,
she was like...

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:36.415
-Alex: Get that
mother [bleep] actor away

00:03:36.415 --> 00:03:39.085
from my mother [bleep] job.
-We have a great show.

